WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.500
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.166
the importance of devotion.

3
00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:36.958
In the next two verses, Lord Krishna explains

4
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:41.041
what result is obtained
 from practicing pure devotion?

5
00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.250
And how does this give liberation

6
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.583
from the cycle of birth and death?

7
00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:47.875
Through which ultimately the devotee

8
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:51.041
attains His supreme abode.

9
00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:58.041
Lord Krishna says –

10
00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:00.666
'Focus your mind on Me.'

11
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:03.291
He says this focusing of the mind

12
00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.958
is very important

13
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:06.875
and excellent rewards

14
00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:09.083
or fruits are obtained.

15
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:11.041
He says that those who worship Him

16
00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:14.541
with pure devotion, 'mām upetya,'

17
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:18.541
they don't return to this
 'duḥkhālayam aśāśvatam,' 

18
00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:23.416
meaning temporary and suffering-filled world.

19
00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.625
Opposite to the ideal phrase shown

20
00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:28.791
in stories and films

21
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:33.458
'...and they lived happily ever after,'

22
00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:37.125
reality is completely different.

23
00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:38.458
In the Gita's context,

24
00:01:38.458 --> 00:01:41.291
Lord Krishna sees the world's sorrowful nature

25
00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:44.500
as an accepted reality.

26
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.250
Like an employee of a grand building

27
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.291
accepts the difficulty and boredom

28
00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:51.500
behind that grand environment.

29
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.875
He further explains that mahātmās,

30
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:57.083
who stabilize their consciousness on Him,

31
00:01:57.083 --> 00:02:00.083
attain 'paramāṁ gataḥ,'

32
00:02:00.083 --> 00:02:02.458
meaning the supreme destination,

33
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.625
which is His eternal abode.

34
00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:06.000
Krishna calls those rare

35
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.916
devotees 'mahātmās'

36
00:02:07.916 --> 00:02:09.750
who, by surrendering to Him,

37
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.833
accept Him as the supreme truth.

38
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:16.666
He connects this idea with earlier teachings,

39
00:02:16.666 --> 00:02:20.291
like in the ninth verse of the
 Bhagavad Gita's fourth chapter,

40
00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:24.083
where He says that understanding His divine

41
00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:27.916
activities gives liberation.

42
00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:31.416
By shedding light on the futility of searching
 for happiness in the material world,

43
00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:34.958
Krishna urges devotees

44
00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:38.875
to focus on the spiritual path,

45
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:42.250
which ensures they never have to return

46
00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:46.083
to this momentary world.

47
00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:53.541
Have you ever thought

48
00:02:53.541 --> 00:02:59.166
how much suffering the very
 desire to 'live happily always'

49
00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:03.208
in this world gives you?

50
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:06.375
In this world, you often run after dreams

51
00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:10.791
of 'living happily always.'

52
00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:12.291
But when events

53
00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:15.666
don't happen as expected,

54
00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.625
you sink into an ocean of disappointment.

55
00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:21.583
I've told you,

56
00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:24.583
this world is duḥkhālayam

57
00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:27.416
aśāśvatam –

58
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:29.041
filled with suffering,

59
00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:34.208
a temporary residence.

60
00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:35.791
Just as a castle built on sand

61
00:03:35.791 --> 00:03:39.333
gets erased by waves,

62
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:44.458
similarly happiness here is also momentary.

63
00:03:44.458 --> 00:03:48.000
When you realize this truth,

64
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.666
you can understand your expectations,

65
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:52.458
improve them,

66
00:03:52.458 --> 00:03:56.125
and end your suffering.

67
00:03:56.125 --> 00:03:59.666
This world's nature is unstable

68
00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:04.458
and changeable.

69
00:04:04.458 --> 00:04:06.416
By accepting this,

70
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:08.208
you can adopt a balanced

71
00:04:08.208 --> 00:04:10.958
perspective in life,

72
00:04:10.958 --> 00:04:15.416
where ups and downs
 don't disturb your inner peace.

73
00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:19.125
Your real goal should be to
 adopt the path of spiritual practice

74
00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:23.500
and stabilize your mind

75
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.250
on Me.

76
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:31.708
When you experience eternal
 bliss in our relationship

77
00:04:31.708 --> 00:04:34.708
instead of momentary

78
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:37.708
and material gains,

79
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:42.208
you become free from unnecessary troubles.

80
00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:46.083
Therefore, learn to see the world as it is,

81
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:47.791
meaning 'residence of temporary

82
00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:52.500
happiness and sorrow.'

83
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.500
By knowing its real nature,

84
00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:58.583
you protect your heart

85
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.666
and keep the mind concentrated.

86
00:05:01.666 --> 00:05:04.250
Then with Me you develop such

87
00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:07.625
an indestructible relationship

88
00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:12.208
in which you experience true peace.

89
00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:19.250
In the world,

90
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.083
the bonds

91
00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:24.500
we consider most intimate,

92
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.583
sometimes those very ones

93
00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:31.583
give us the most pain.

94
00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:33.625
In family life,

95
00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:38.333
seeking solution to every problem is natural.

96
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:42.875
But you need to realize

97
00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:45.500
that some problems can be solved,

98
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.208
while some cannot.

99
00:05:48.208 --> 00:05:50.125
Just like seasons,

100
00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:54.500
happiness and sorrow come and go in life too.

101
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.791
The sunlight

102
00:05:55.791 --> 00:05:58.750
that feels pleasant in winter

103
00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.833
becomes scorching,

104
00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:06.833
painful in summer.

105
00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.166
In this perishable world,

106
00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:14.333
your body, your achievements,

107
00:06:14.333 --> 00:06:18.208
and even your relationships –

108
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:20.750
all ultimately

109
00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:25.083
end with death.

110
00:06:25.083 --> 00:06:29.833
By realizing this truth, you can adopt

111
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:33.458
a wise perspective toward life

112
00:06:33.458 --> 00:06:37.583
and avoid becoming excessively anxious

113
00:06:37.583 --> 00:06:39.958
while facing circumstances

114
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:43.500
over which you have no control.

115
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.791
You should live your life this way

116
00:06:47.791 --> 00:06:49.750
and help your family

117
00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:53.875
live life this way too,

118
00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:56.791
so the goal of liberation

119
00:06:56.791 --> 00:07:00.000
from this suffering-filled life can be obtained.

120
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:05.583
Inspire your family to focus
 on the spiritual path,

121
00:07:05.583 --> 00:07:09.291
to have affection for Me,

122
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:11.458
so that when the time comes,

123
00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:16.208
you all can be liberated from this world

124
00:07:16.208 --> 00:07:17.750
and the condition

125
00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.583
of returning here doesn't even remain.

126
00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:24.458
Help each other find not momentary peace

127
00:07:24.458 --> 00:07:30.208
but eternal peace,

128
00:07:30.208 --> 00:07:31.333
knowing

129
00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:33.750
that real wisdom

130
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:37.500
lies not in temporary happiness but

131
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:41.458
in desiring liberation.

132
00:07:41.458 --> 00:07:44.666
When your family gathers together

133
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:47.666
and becomes absorbed in My contemplation,

134
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:49.583
then you all together

135
00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:52.583
will attain that supreme state

136
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:56.250
where the family's joy is imperishable

137
00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.458
and infinite.

138
00:08:03.291 --> 00:08:05.416
Just as a bamboo tree bends in fierce

139
00:08:05.416 --> 00:08:08.875
wind but doesn't break,

140
00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:12.208
similarly a person enriched
 with spiritual knowledge

141
00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:17.750
remains steady even in professional storms.

142
00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.083
In your professional life,

143
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:23.791
you'll continuously face challenges. However

144
00:08:23.791 --> 00:08:28.375
skilled or successful you are,
 crises will come – whether

145
00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:30.833
harsh deadlines,

146
00:08:30.833 --> 00:08:32.666
conflicts within the team,

147
00:08:32.666 --> 00:08:34.916
or financial ups and downs.

148
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:39.416
Understand that this world is duḥkhālayam,

149
00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:41.541
a place of struggle.

150
00:08:41.541 --> 00:08:45.833
The work field is no exception to this.

151
00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:46.791
In the professional world

152
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:50.750
too, there are challenges every moment.

153
00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:51.916
When you observe

154
00:08:51.916 --> 00:08:55.125
problems from a spiritual perspective,

155
00:08:55.125 --> 00:08:59.833
you start seeing them in a different light.

156
00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:03.958
Just as I describe this world as impermanent

157
00:09:03.958 --> 00:09:07.541
and full of ups and downs,

158
00:09:07.541 --> 00:09:11.916
similarly you can remind yourself

159
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:15.125
that these challenges are also momentary.

160
00:09:15.125 --> 00:09:18.416
They keep coming and going, and the mind's

161
00:09:18.416 --> 00:09:23.583
inner peace shouldn't be disturbed by them.

162
00:09:23.583 --> 00:09:25.583
By accepting this world's nature

163
00:09:25.583 --> 00:09:29.791
in your heart, you make your professional

164
00:09:29.791 --> 00:09:33.041
burden more bearable.

165
00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:36.291
You learn to handle problems
 without getting excessively

166
00:09:36.291 --> 00:09:40.875
entangled in disappointment or restlessness.

167
00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:44.000
When you work with this balanced mindset,

168
00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:51.041
you face obstacles with patience and clarity,

169
00:09:51.041 --> 00:09:52.541
knowing

170
00:09:52.541 --> 00:09:57.333
they're merely part of material experience.

171
00:09:57.333 --> 00:09:58.708
This perspective

172
00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.916
helps you focus on truly important elements,

173
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:06.291
like performing your duties

174
00:10:06.291 --> 00:10:09.541
excellently,

175
00:10:09.541 --> 00:10:12.958
while maintaining

176
00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:16.333
relationship with Me.

177
00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:18.750
Through always remembering Me,

178
00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.666
you gain power to remain calm

179
00:10:20.666 --> 00:10:24.541
and move forward,

180
00:10:24.541 --> 00:10:28.125
whatever keeps happening.
